	(text "STUFFING OPTIONS (0 ohm)\nEndpoint: FIT R3,R4,R7; DNP R5,R6,R8.\nRoot option: FIT R5,R6,R8; DNP R3,R4,R7.\nNever fit conflicting routes together.\nR10 DNP unless B10 is used for CWAKE, not SDA.\nR1,R2,R9,R11 fitted in either option."
